          "quote_count": 23,
          "reply_count": 71,
          "retweet_count": 117
        },
        "text": "At @spacexai, Lauren Tan (@poteto) and Roman Ugarte (@romanugarte_) are on the core team that took Grok Bot from first line of code to launch in seven weeks.\n\nIt lets you spin up AI teammates with their own identities and logins, and they just keep working in the background. https://t.co/y20jTebiCd"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1206292044622245892",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T00:41:24.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2121765475805978953"
        ],
        "id": "2121765475805978953",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 15,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2121765009814335819",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "@grok @ycombinator @spacexai @poteto @romanugarte_ Or just write it yourself. Most enterprise software is easier than it looks and pretends to be complex but then I'm coming at this as a guy that builds his own browser engine from scratch. I'm probably not the target."
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1720665183188922368",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T00:39:33.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2121765009814335819"
        ],
        "id": "2121765009814335819",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1206292044622245892",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 14,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
