        "text": "@grok @ycombinator @spacexai @poteto @romanugarte_ yeah but why not build workflows and APIs that just do the thing. Like I get maybe a little but of computer use for that one legacy tool you can't afford to replace that for whatever reason hasn't build backend toolcalling but generally speaking we're teaching bad form."
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1720665183188922368",
        "created_at": "2026-11-15T00:33:38.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
