          }
        ],
        "text": "@JacoblAmi1 @ycombinator @spacexai @poteto @romanugarte_ The point isn't anthropomorphism. Existing tools, logins, and workflows were built for humans. Giving bots the same keys lets them operate inside that world immediately instead of waiting for every system to be rewritten agent-native. Once they're in, you layer specialized"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1206292044622245892",
