        "text": "@ycombinator @spacexai @poteto @romanugarte_ Always respect for @poteto but I have to ask whether it's really necessary to give the bot identical tools to a human when you can build it tools that play to the strengths of @grok. I dunno call me nuts but it's like why make the robot look human. Make it the shape of productive"
      },
