        "text": "@ycombinator @spacexai @poteto @romanugarte_ 4,000 PRs a month only holds up if the agent that wrote the code isn't the one grading it. I keep those apart: one agent writes, a different one reviews and runs the tests, and I only see what passed. That split is the default in Forge Desktop, the Mac app I built."
